TO : BBG/S
CC : CEC, CDA, SST, SSC, CTS, CTF, CCM, CCA, CCE, CCB, CCS, RAS, RWA, RUR, RNA

FM : CTY





Weekly Forecast Report(WK 47)





1. FCST Overall & Changes for TPS & AES

[cid:1D81.jpg@12345678.87654321]

※ Red-colored percentage : bigger than -5% decrease from previous week.





2. TPS FCST trend

[cid:F614.jpg@12345678.87654321]

[cid:340F.jpg@12345678.87654321]

 - [PS overall] : Overall  FCST is dropping continuously, need all office's attention of promotion.

 - [PSI] : WK50 is Blank confirmed.

 - [PSX] : WK50/HJKO0022E USOAK drop, need to divert BKGs to other service lanes calling USOAK.

 - [PN overall] : More load-up required.

 - [AWK/AWC] : L/F continuously lower than other AWE lanes. Effort of promoting cargoes necessary.







3. AES FCST trend

[cid:7BC9.jpg@12345678.87654321]

[cid:C132.jpg@12345678.87654321]

 - [NE6] : Weight control is requested and please pay keen attention for smallest size vessel at WK51.

 - [NE2] : WK49 skip HAM & WK50 skip FXT, FCST decreased, more load up required for other PODs.

 - [NE3] : FCST slightly decreases for all voyages, now avg. 95%. Please promote more cargoes.

 - [MD1/2] : Any load up or space request is highly welcome for WK 47/48/49 vessels. Excepting MD1 WK49.

 - [PSI] : Italy cargo promotion is necessary.

 - [IMU] : BSA reduced of 37% from WK52, will guide revised allocation.







4. IAS FCST trend by destination/origin (head haul / back haul)

[cid:FCEB.jpg@12345678.87654321]



 - [FMX/PSG] : High shortfall ratio. Pay more keen attention on shortfall and give prompt feedback to CTY/CCE/RHQ.

 - [FMX] : HNMI0078W please give priority to lighter cargoes for max load-up of this bigger vessel.

 - [KPI/HNJE0035E] : Minimizing vol to INC/DLC and XGG is surely required due to the serious congestion at PUS.

 - [CKI/KKIC1316W] : BSA will be temporarily increased to 200. Please gather more cargoes than usual.

   ※ Specified guideline will be noticed shortly.







5. EMS FCST trend

[cid:BFA.jpg@12345678.87654321]

 - [LW2] : from R.WK 50, BSA will be decreased of half. All vessel name will be changed and to be guided shortly.

   ※ QTA/Allocation will be revised according to the decreased BSA.

   ※ LW1 remains unchanged.





//End of Report//



Sincerely,

Jungmin Lee

CTY-AE

82) 2 3770 6556

